Fewer serious current-affairs programmes, more chat shows and women's magazines. The public starts to see a person, not a political phenomenon.

@popular_press
title: Win over the popular press
subtitle: Skilled and working-class voters warm to us.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Shadow Cabinet action.
